ng it  I am withholding judgment for the time  being as to how much responsibility and  credit lies with Donald Trump here but  I'm interested in hearing from you what  specifically do you think Trump has done  if anything that affords him credit for  the progress that has been made so far  I'm open to hearing views from the  audience about this including on Twitter  you can find me on Twitter at D Pakman  the show is on twitter at david pakman  show and we have a fantastic program for  you today the video you just finished  watching was made possible by you  through the membership program you can  sign up for membership at david  pakman.com slash membership we are  viewer supported independent media you  can use the coupon code  I voted 17 for a 40% discount off of  your membership

